        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break your opponents!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Breaker League, one coin flip can crown a champion… or end your run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re the newest contender in an endless competition where every match bends the rules and every rival Breakers wants you gone. Test your team, your nerve, and your luck as you fight your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find, collect, and battle with over 60 unique beasts:</strong> From undead teddy bears who refuse to stay down, to shapeshifting marsupials, to leviathans that crush the battlefield in a single strike.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Beasts mid-match</strong> for sudden bursts of power, and deeper stratedgy. Then watch them return to normal after the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle others Online (PvP) </strong>for bragging rights! Share your Lobby Code with anyone to have them join and battle against you! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip special items</strong> onto your Beasts to twist their abilities in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigger the ultimate move - a TurnBreak -</strong> to end the round on your terms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your Echo </strong>- shadow versions of yourself from previous runs - and prove you’ve grown stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle your Chat </strong>– With Twitch integration: Let your viewers influence battles by voting on your opponent's next move in real-time. Streamers, it’s you vs your chat!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to become the Ultimate Breaker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a gamble. Every floor has new dangers. Every turn can be broken. <strong>How far will you go before the League breaks you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break your opponents!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/2fd5e25e89fc3d993494dfd13fed4b0a.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Breaker League, one coin flip can crown a champion… or end your run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re the newest contender in an endless competition where every match bends the rules and every rival Breakers wants you gone. Test your team, your nerve, and your luck as you fight your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/f5f3e3ffb8c83b44c54bb0e12bf64919.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find, collect, and battle with over 60 unique beasts:</strong> From undead teddy bears who refuse to stay down, to shapeshifting marsupials, to leviathans that crush the battlefield in a single strike.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Beasts mid-match</strong> for sudden bursts of power, and deeper stratedgy. Then watch them return to normal after the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle others Online (PvP) </strong>for bragging rights! Share your Lobby Code with anyone to have them join and battle against you! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip special items</strong> onto your Beasts to twist their abilities in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigger the ultimate move - a TurnBreak -</strong> to end the round on your terms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your Echo </strong>- shadow versions of yourself from previous runs - and prove you’ve grown stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle your Chat </strong>– With Twitch integration: Let your viewers influence battles by voting on your opponent's next move in real-time. Streamers, it’s you vs your chat!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to become the Ultimate Breaker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a gamble. Every floor has new dangers. Every turn can be broken. <strong>How far will you go before the League breaks you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.poster.avif?t=1772055010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.webm?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532720/extras/68cbe0e486ff31e9a3f25d1f709b2f13.mp4?t=1772055010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
